    metaTitle: 'Wood vs Composite vs PVC Decking Comparison 2026 | Loudoun Decks',
    metaDescription: 'Compare the pros, cons, and costs of pressure-treated wood, composite decking, and premium PVC decking materials for your Northern Virginia home.',
